Description: Performant, batteries-included completion plugin for neovim
 blink.cmp is a completion plugin with support for LSPs, cmdline, signature
 help and snippets. It uses an optional custom fuzzy matcher for typo
 resistance. It provides extensibility via pluggable sources (LSP, buffer,
 snippets, etc), component based rendering and dynamic configuration.

